  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Cook the vermicelli pasta according to package instructions and set aside.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together soy sauce, rice vinegar, and sesame oil.",
    "Add the cooked pasta, grilled shiitake mushrooms, green onions, pickled ginger, and tofu to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "Thread the pasta mixture onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Place the skewers on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper and brush with yakitori sauce.",
    "Sprinkle sesame seeds over the top of the skewers.",
    "Bake the skewers in the preheated oven for 15 minutes, or until lightly browned.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
